# Step 1: Har Microservice me Dockerfile banao

## Eureka Server Dockerfile

`eureka-server/Dockerfile`

```dockerfile
FROM eclipse-temurin:17-jdk

WORKDIR /app

COPY target/*.jar app.jar

EXPOSE 8761

ENTRYPOINT ["java","-jar","app.jar"]
```

